  eventID: RepeatedLightsInteractionThree
  dialogueLines:
  - Okay, this is starting to get annoying. Keep playing with those lights and see
    what happens
  - "Right, that\u2019s enough now. Keep messing with the lights and you might regret
    it"
  - "I\u2019m warning you, you really don\u2019t want to keep doing that"
  - "Okay, you\u2019ve had your fun. Try that again and we\u2019re going to have
    a problem"
  - This was amusing for about five seconds. Keep going and see where it gets you
  - Seriously, stop messing with the lights before I decide to do something about
    it
  - "You\u2019re really testing my patience now. Go on, keep doing it"
  - "Fine. If you want to keep playing with the lights, don\u2019t say I didn\u2019t
    warn you"
  - "This is becoming incredibly annoying. I\u2019d suggest finding something else
    to do"
  - "Keep flicking those lights if you want. Let\u2019s see how long you enjoy it"
  canRepeat: 0
  priority: 1
